stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR

  pending_payment --> confirmed : verified payment success (BR-1)
  pending_payment --> cancelled : all attempts failed / hold expired
  confirmed --> checked_in : staff check-in (BR-4, append-only)
  confirmed --> refunded : no workflow built (PRD §20)
  confirmed --> cancelled

  initiated --> processing : routed to provider
  processing --> success : server-verified (BR-1)
  processing --> failed
  processing --> pending
  pending --> success
  pending --> failed

  success --> confirmed : BR-1 cross-machine link

  note right of confirmed
    FORBIDDEN transitions — enforced by DB trigger / CHECK (SQLSTATE 23514):
    - Registration: cancelled → confirmed
    - Registration: cancelled / refunded → checked_in
    - Registration: checked_in → pending_payment (no backward transitions)
    - Payment: failed → success on the same row (create a new Payment instead)

    `confirmed` is reachable ONLY via independently-verified payment success (BR-1).
  end note
